From b0ec35dc080e15057ab130698ecea00deb86e1af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:43:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gi): Anastasya's To the New World buffs the party

Her Elemental Burst in the Blessing of Love increases the party's
Stellar-Conduct and Stellar Swirl DMG by its Stellar Glimmer Reaction
DMG Increase (50% at Lv. 10, scaling with burst level and C3), behind
a "To the New World (Q after E tap)" toggle on the burst card.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Asb8vZRqeTYT9zLpVizGNv
---
 .../builtinCustom/anastasya-silverdawn.json   | 22 ++++++++++++++++
 tools/custom-characters/buffs/10000149.json   | 25 ++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libs/gi/consts/src/builtinCustom/anastasya-silverdawn.json b/libs/gi/consts/src/builtinCustom/anastasya-silverdawn.json
