--- a/tools/custom-characters/buffs/10000149.json
+++ b/tools/custom-characters/buffs/10000149.json
@@ -6,7 +6,8 @@
     "C1 and C4 entries add to the lower constellations, so totals match, e.g. C4 with Anastasya Sealed: others 62.4% CRIT DMG.",
     "C2 Honor: Blessed Armament Normal Attacks (skill rows), The Evernight Yields to Dawn and Doom deal 125% of their original DMG.",
     "C6 Honor extra Doom hit: Anastasya holds the Accolades of the 3 other members (+3 x 15.6% CRIT DMG, +3 x 19.5% ATK), assuming none is Sealed.",
-    "Not included: A4 (Stellar Swirl base reaction multiplier +15%, no matching GO stat)."
+    "Not included: A4 (Stellar Swirl base reaction multiplier +15%, no matching GO stat).",
+    "To the New World (Q in Blessing of Love): party Stellar-Conduct and Stellar Swirl DMG + the burst's Stellar Glimmer Reaction DMG Increase (50% at Lv10), behind its own toggle."
   ],
